In a file window, type a line then erase by word (^W) and line (^U), exercising
ctlw/ctlu and the local-cut backspacing across word boundaries.

-- input --
move 300 8
button 4
move 300 116
button 0
move 200 150
button 4
move 480 330
button 0
move 250 170
button 1
button 0
type aa bb cc
key ctrl-w
key ctrl-w
key ctrl-u
key ctrl-u
key ctrl-w
move 100 10
button 1
button 0
-- waitframes --
29 29 51 54 55 55 57 63 107 107 109 109 113 117 121 125 129 133 137 141 145 149 153 160 166 166 182 182
